<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">hikarabita kotoba wo tsunai de</font></font></b></font></font>

4
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:20,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">connecting old words that have<font color="#ffffff"> been used up</font></font></font></b></font></font>

5
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:28,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">soredemo bokura shinpuru na omoi wo tsutaetai dake na no</font></font></b></font></font>

6
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:28,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">I just want to convey my simple thoughts</font></font></b></font></font>

7
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:34,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">fukinukeru kusunda ano hi no kaze wa</font></font></b></font></font>

8
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:34,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">that day's faint wind blows away</font></font></b></font></font>

9
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kinou no haikyo ni uchi sutete</font></font></b></font></font>

10
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">at the castle ruins of yesterday</font></font></b></font></font>

11
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kimi to warau ima wo ikiru no da</font></font></b></font></font>

12
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">I'll laugh with you and live for the moment</font></font></b></font></font>

13
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">soredemo ano dekigoto ga kimi wo kurushimeru daro</font></font></b></font></font>

14
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">still that incident will continue to trouble you, right?</font></font></b></font></font>

15
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">dakarakoso sayonara nanda</font></font></b></font></font>

16
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">that's why it must be good-bye</font></font></b></font></font>

17
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">konomama nanimo nokorazu ni anata to wakachiau dake</font></font></b></font></font>

18
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">leaving nothing behind, let us share what is left</font></font></b></font></font>

19
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yagate bokura wa sore ga subetee dato kigatsuite</font></font></b></font></font>

20
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">in time, we'll realize that it was everything</font></font></b></font></font>

21
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kanashimi wa hoo wo tsutatte namida no kawa ni naru dake</font></font></b></font></font>

22
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">and sadness will touch our cheeks, creating a river of tears</font></font></b></font></font>

23
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yureru omoi wa tsuyoi uzu ni n<font color="#ffffff">atte tokeau no yo</font></font></font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">Trembling thoughts swept into a vortex and melting away</font></font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:42,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is not good,
looks like a storm is coming.</font>

26
00:01:42,910 --> 00:01:43,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

27
00:01:46,330 --> 00:01:47,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate...</font>

28
00:01:47,790 --> 00:01:53,800
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Run Idate!</font>

29
00:01:47,790 --> 00:01:53,800
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Stormy Disturbance</font>

30
00:01:47,790 --> 00:01:53,800
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">of Nagi Island!!</font>

31
00:02:01,510 --> 00:02:02,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rokusho... Aoi!</font>

32
00:02:04,270 --> 00:02:06,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought you had run away.</font>

33
00:02:08,310 --> 00:02:10,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wasn't running away
your specialty?</font>

34
00:02:11,770 --> 00:02:12,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

35
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:14,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm different from you!</font>

36
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:18,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, you are the same kind
of human as I am.</font>

37
00:02:19,820 --> 00:02:22,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A betrayer who doesn't trust others.</font>

38
00:02:22,660 --> 00:02:26,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Betraying your own brother,
walking away from the village,</font>

39
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:30,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and capable of thinking only of yourself.
The worst kind of man.</font>

40
00:02:35,300 --> 00:02:37,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such a man...
doesn't deserve to live!</font>

41
00:02:50,770 --> 00:02:51,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die!</font>

42
00:02:57,780 --> 00:03:00,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, is your wound okay?</font>

43
00:03:00,360 --> 00:03:01,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh-huh.</font>

44
00:03:01,700 --> 00:03:03,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A wound like this is nothing.</font>

45
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:04,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

46
00:03:06,040 --> 00:03:07,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those Rain Ninja... huh?</font>

47
00:03:07,700 --> 00:03:08,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

48
00:03:08,500 --> 00:03:11,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hah, they're nothing!</font>

49
00:03:11,500 --> 00:03:15,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, it's not that!
If they're headed towards Idate...</font>

50
00:03:18,130 --> 00:03:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Idate is in danger!</font>

51
00:03:20,300 --> 00:03:22,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what I've been saying!</font>

52
00:03:25,810 --> 00:03:28,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Naruto!
This is no time to be playing around.</font>

53
00:03:29,140 --> 00:03:29,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

54
00:03:30,350 --> 00:03:31,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're here now.</font>

55
00:03:38,110 --> 00:03:38,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

56
00:03:39,570 --> 00:03:40,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lucky us!</font>

57
00:03:41,150 --> 00:03:43,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We are invincible in water.</font>

58
00:03:46,660 --> 00:03:48,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Geez, what a troublesome guy.</font>

59
00:03:49,330 --> 00:03:51,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They've now fallen into our trap.</font>

60
00:03:52,830 --> 00:03:54,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Water Clone Jutsu!</font>

61
00:04:03,970 --> 00:04:04,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!</font>

62
00:04:13,020 --> 00:04:15,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

63
00:04:24,910 --> 00:04:29,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How stupid. What use can
Shadow Clones have in this situation?</font>

64
00:04:29,870 --> 00:04:34,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way they can defeat
our Water Clones in water.</font>

65
00:04:34,540 --> 00:04:37,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you try to trick us,</font>

66
00:04:37,460 --> 00:04:40,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm hanging on to the real body
right here.</font>

67
00:05:05,950 --> 00:05:07,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are they trying to do?</font>

68
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:30,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-No way!</font>

69
00:05:31,640 --> 00:05:35,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a whirlpool...
Chakra is intertwined in it!</font>

70
00:05:35,430 --> 00:05:36,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto... you...</font>

71
00:05:43,320 --> 00:05:44,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the application
of the first step</font>

72
00:05:44,690 --> 00:05:47,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in my training for
the Rasengan!</font>

73
00:05:54,410 --> 00:05:55,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!</font>

74
00:05:59,710 --> 00:06:01,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, hang in there!</font>

75
00:06:14,140 --> 00:06:16,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura! Just hang in there!</font>

76
00:06:16,520 --> 00:06:17,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on! Sakura!</font>

77
00:06:34,660 --> 00:06:35,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!</font>

78
00:06:35,870 --> 00:06:37,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pull yourself together! Sakura!</font>

79
00:06:38,410 --> 00:06:41,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I guess... I've got... to... do it...</font>

80
00:06:46,670 --> 00:06:48,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Sasuke....</font>

81
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:51,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd like it if Sasuke is the one to do...</font>

82
00:06:52,550 --> 00:06:54,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the CPR...</font>

83
00:07:00,020 --> 00:07:01,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Sakura...</font>

84
00:07:05,270 --> 00:07:07,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell are you doing, idiot!</font>

85
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:11,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke?</font>

86
00:07:12,280 --> 00:07:15,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We don't have any time to spare.
We need to meet up with Idate.</font>

87
00:07:17,410 --> 00:07:18,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait, Sasuke.</font>

88
00:07:22,830 --> 00:07:24,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey... Don't leave me.</font>

89
00:07:40,730 --> 00:07:41,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's about time...</font>

90
00:07:42,850 --> 00:07:45,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fukusuke reaches Modoroki Shrine.</font>

91
00:07:50,030 --> 00:07:52,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no chance for you
to win now.</font>

92
00:07:59,160 --> 00:08:02,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't even run
or stand up now.</font>

93
00:08:06,590 --> 00:08:09,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When that pain spreads
throughout your whole body,</font>

94
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:12,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you'll reach a different finish line.</font>

95
00:08:18,060 --> 00:08:20,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The finish line of death.</font>

96
00:08:30,860 --> 00:08:35,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you thinking of doing
with that dirty knife?</font>

97
00:08:38,370 --> 00:08:39,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't touch it!</font>

98
00:08:52,800 --> 00:08:56,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like you still don't understand
your situation.</font>

99
00:08:58,430 --> 00:09:01,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All you have to do is run away.</font>

100
00:09:02,430 --> 00:09:05,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have no right to even
the slightest bit of integrity.</font>

101
00:09:22,540 --> 00:09:23,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boss...</font>

102
00:09:28,630 --> 00:09:29,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry...</font>

103
00:09:30,420 --> 00:09:31,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boss...</font>

104
00:09:33,460 --> 00:09:35,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I couldn't keep...</font>

105
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:39,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the promise I made with you.</font>

106
00:09:41,930 --> 00:09:43,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate!</font>

107
00:09:55,400 --> 00:09:56,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You bastard!</font>

108
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:07,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">damn, what a downpour.</font>

109
00:10:08,670 --> 00:10:11,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you the boss of the Rain Ninja?!</font>

110
00:10:13,460 --> 00:10:16,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like it was too hard
a task for them.</font>

111
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:18,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if they were
the same Genin as you,</font>

112
00:10:18,430 --> 00:10:20,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">seems like the Hidden Leaf ones
are better.</font>

113
00:10:22,760 --> 00:10:23,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is terrible...</font>

114
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:29,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But can Genin-level Ninja
fight against me?</font>

115
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:31,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

116
00:10:36,190 --> 00:10:36,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Above!</font>

117
00:10:51,630 --> 00:10:53,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph... So that's your level, after all.</font>

118
00:10:54,500 --> 00:10:57,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll use the same method
I used on Idate,</font>

119
00:10:58,970 --> 00:11:00,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and send you to hell.</font>

120
00:11:03,680 --> 00:11:06,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No need to waste my Chakra.</font>

121
00:11:08,810 --> 00:11:09,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!</font>

122
00:11:14,690 --> 00:11:16,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Th-These damned things...</font>

123
00:11:16,860 --> 00:11:19,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those are poisoned needles specially
made by the Hidden Rain Village.</font>

124
00:11:19,740 --> 00:11:21,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They will send you to hell
in a few minutes,</font>

125
00:11:21,740 --> 00:11:23,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">no matter how strong you are.</font>

126
00:11:23,700 --> 00:11:25,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you look down on us! Bastard...!</font>

127
00:11:31,040 --> 00:11:33,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like Fukusuke has reached
Modoroki Shrine.</font>

128
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:35,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die gasping.</font>

129
00:11:36,090 --> 00:11:38,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a death
that fits you Genin brats well.</font>

130
00:11:47,560 --> 00:11:49,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is Wagarashi winning this one too?</font>

131
00:11:49,930 --> 00:11:52,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't there a God or Buddha
in this world?</font>

132
00:11:53,230 --> 00:11:56,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I miss the old times when
Jirocho was in charge.</font>

133
00:12:02,950 --> 00:12:05,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Terrible, terrible, I'm drenched.</font>

134
00:12:05,950 --> 00:12:07,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are amazing, Fukusuke.</font>

135
00:12:07,740 --> 00:12:11,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Keep on running to the goal,
and make our Boss Wagarashi happy.</font>

136
00:12:12,540 --> 00:12:14,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Watch it, you scum.</font>

137
00:12:14,500 --> 00:12:16,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who do you think you are talking to?</font>

138
00:12:16,710 --> 00:12:17,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

139
00:12:17,800 --> 00:12:21,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My victory is already assured.
Let me relax for a while.</font>

140
00:12:21,970 --> 00:12:23,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bastard, think you're so hot?!</font>

141
00:12:23,680 --> 00:12:24,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cut it out...
Brother...</font>

142
00:12:25,590 --> 00:12:27,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What if something goes wrong
during the race?</font>

143
00:12:27,760 --> 00:12:29,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who knows what our boss
will do to us.</font>

144
00:12:30,600 --> 00:12:31,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right.</font>

145
00:12:32,270 --> 00:12:33,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just wait and see.</font>

146
00:12:41,650 --> 00:12:43,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">damn, that bastard!</font>

147
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:44,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, Sasuke...</font>

148
00:12:45,780 --> 00:12:46,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this.</font>

149
00:12:47,370 --> 00:12:48,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura... What's that?</font>

150
00:12:51,790 --> 00:12:53,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Before leaving the Leaf Village,</font>

151
00:12:54,870 --> 00:12:56,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama handed this to me.</font>

152
00:12:57,250 --> 00:13:00,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this with you.
I am sure it will come in handy.</font>

153
00:13:00,960 --> 00:13:02,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma Tsunade?</font>

154
00:13:07,140 --> 00:13:09,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think he'll recover
consciousness now.</font>

155
00:13:10,600 --> 00:13:12,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke and Naruto,
you take this, too.</font>

156
00:13:12,770 --> 00:13:14,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">O-Okay.</font>

157
00:13:14,560 --> 00:13:19,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Also, we'll be too cold here,
so we need to move somewhere else.</font>

158
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:24,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Brother!</font>

159
00:13:31,870 --> 00:13:34,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look! I've finally become
a Ninja, too!</font>

160
00:13:35,870 --> 00:13:36,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

161
00:13:36,670 --> 00:13:39,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've got to become the best
in everything!</font>

162
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:43,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll train hard,
and complete lots of missions.</font>

163
00:13:44,010 --> 00:13:46,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I'll become a Chunin super fast.</font>

164
00:13:47,010 --> 00:13:48,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then after that, a Jonin.</font>

165
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:50,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to be like you, Brother!</font>

166
00:13:51,640 --> 00:13:54,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Idate, the Swift Runner
making headway in life.</font>

167
00:13:55,350 --> 00:13:56,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Brother?</font>

168
00:13:59,860 --> 00:14:01,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen Idate...</font>

169
00:14:02,980 --> 00:14:04,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the world of Shinobi,</font>

170
00:14:04,780 --> 00:14:08,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there is something more important
than success or power.</font>

171
00:14:08,360 --> 00:14:09,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something more important?</font>

172
00:14:10,450 --> 00:14:14,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Until you understand that,
it's too early for you to talk that way.</font>

173
00:14:24,340 --> 00:14:25,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

174
00:14:25,130 --> 00:14:26,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's conscious now.</font>

175
00:14:27,880 --> 00:14:28,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you okay?</font>

176
00:14:29,260 --> 00:14:31,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened to Aoi?!</font>

177
00:14:32,260 --> 00:14:33,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He disappeared...</font>

178
00:14:33,600 --> 00:14:35,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that Rain Ninja is called Aoi?</font>

179
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:41,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate, do you know him?</font>

180
00:14:43,020 --> 00:14:43,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He...</font>

181
00:14:44,780 --> 00:14:47,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...was a teacher when
I was in the Leaf Village.</font>

182
00:14:47,280 --> 00:14:49,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... are from the Leaf Village?</font>

183
00:14:50,160 --> 00:14:53,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aoi... betrayed the Leaf Village</font>

184
00:14:53,620 --> 00:14:55,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and became a Jonin of the Hidden Rain.</font>

185
00:14:55,870 --> 00:14:58,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell do you mean?</font>

186
00:15:00,960 --> 00:15:02,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not yet.</font>

187
00:15:02,710 --> 00:15:04,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have to rest a little more.</font>

188
00:15:05,670 --> 00:15:06,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How is your hand there?</font>

189
00:15:08,920 --> 00:15:09,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That hand...</font>

190
00:15:09,970 --> 00:15:11,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You kept it clenched all this time.</font>

191
00:15:17,560 --> 00:15:20,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">damn! I'd come all this way,
and yet I...!</font>

192
00:15:20,690 --> 00:15:22,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too early to give up!</font>

193
00:15:23,060 --> 00:15:25,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And you tell us that you were once
a Shinobi of the Leaf?!</font>

194
00:15:27,280 --> 00:15:30,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I forgot all about the Leaf...</font>

195
00:15:30,780 --> 00:15:32,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the moment
I walked away from the village.</font>

196
00:15:33,370 --> 00:15:34,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You walked away from the village?</font>

197
00:15:37,160 --> 00:15:42,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was depressed after failing
the first test of the Chunin Exam.</font>

198
00:15:44,880 --> 00:15:46,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was close, Idate...</font>

199
00:15:51,130 --> 00:15:52,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't take it so hard.</font>

200
00:15:53,180 --> 00:15:56,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are ways to become
a Chunin other than the Chunin Exam.</font>

201
00:15:57,760 --> 00:15:58,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really?!</font>

202
00:16:00,560 --> 00:16:02,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, really.</font>

203
00:16:03,650 --> 00:16:05,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just do as I tell you.</font>

204
00:16:06,230 --> 00:16:07,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

205
00:16:14,870 --> 00:16:15,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aoi-sensei...</font>

206
00:16:17,030 --> 00:16:17,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idate...</font>

207
00:16:18,830 --> 00:16:22,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aoi-sensei,
I'd brought them as you told me to.</font>

208
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:25,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right.</font>

209
00:16:26,460 --> 00:16:30,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These are indeed the Scroll of Sealing
and the legendary blade,</font>

210
00:16:30,300 --> 00:16:33,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Blade of the Thunder God, believed to
have been used by the Second Hokage.</font>

211
00:16:34,550 --> 00:16:35,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well done, Idate.</font>

212
00:16:36,600 --> 00:16:39,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now I can become a Chunin, right?</font>

213
00:16:39,930 --> 00:16:41,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure you can...</font>

214
00:16:44,020 --> 00:16:45,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the Village Hidden in the Rain.</font>

215
00:16:49,530 --> 00:16:52,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are leaving
the Leaf together with me,</font>

216
00:16:52,690 --> 00:16:54,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">taking these as gifts to them.</font>

217
00:16:54,780 --> 00:16:55,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

218
00:16:58,870 --> 00:17:00,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course.</font>

219
00:17:00,490 --> 00:17:04,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way you can get away with
stealing the village's treasures.</font>

220
00:17:04,250 --> 00:17:05,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You tricked me!</font>

221
00:17:06,210 --> 00:17:10,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To survive in this world,
you must not believe in others...</font>

222
00:17:11,170 --> 00:17:12,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Remember that.</font>

223
00:17:15,090 --> 00:17:17,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, what are you going to do, Idate?</font>

224
00:17:18,510 --> 00:17:21,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Either way, you are already
a Rogue Ninja.</font>

225
00:17:23,930 --> 00:17:27,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll be chained in jail for life,
if you are lucky.</font>

226
00:17:31,900 --> 00:17:37,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll be chained in jail for life,
if you are lucky.</font>

227
00:17:44,750 --> 00:17:47,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ever since then,
I haven't returned to the village.</font>

228
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:52,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am an irresponsible man
who can't do a single thing right.</font>

229
00:17:53,260 --> 00:17:55,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Boss Jirocho believed in me.</font>

230
00:17:56,550 --> 00:18:01,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though I'd never
been of any use to him.</font>

231
00:18:01,850 --> 00:18:03,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boss Jirocho had faith in me!</font>

232
00:18:04,270 --> 00:18:06,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And yet, I...!</font>

233
00:18:12,610 --> 00:18:13,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's...</font>

234
00:18:15,070 --> 00:18:17,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's... like the old me...</font>

235
00:18:20,120 --> 00:18:24,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No one will ever accept you!
Die Naruto!</font>

236
00:18:26,660 --> 00:18:28,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Duck down, Naruto!</font>

237
00:18:33,630 --> 00:18:36,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm... a worthless guy...</font>

238
00:18:37,300 --> 00:18:39,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Why?</font>

239
00:18:41,260 --> 00:18:42,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because we are the same.</font>

240
00:18:43,640 --> 00:18:45,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's like me of the old days.</font>

241
00:18:46,480 --> 00:18:47,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I go around and around,
and get nowhere...</font>

242
00:18:49,350 --> 00:18:50,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't do anything right.</font>

243
00:18:51,730 --> 00:18:53,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aoi is right.</font>

244
00:18:53,070 --> 00:18:55,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have... no right to live...</font>

245
00:18:56,070 --> 00:18:57,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiot!</font>

246
00:18:58,030 --> 00:19:01,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a person
who still trusts you, right?</font>

247
00:19:02,660 --> 00:19:04,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know, Naruto.</font>

248
00:19:05,660 --> 00:19:10,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You felt alone...
and you were suffering!</font>

249
00:19:11,000 --> 00:19:13,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One is enough!</font>

250
00:19:17,590 --> 00:19:19,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The race isn't over yet!</font>

251
00:19:19,930 --> 00:19:23,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You never know how things will turn out
unless you try until the very end.</font>

252
00:19:25,510 --> 00:19:26,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

253
00:19:27,470 --> 00:19:28,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stand up now!</font>

254
00:19:28,730 --> 00:19:31,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, it's not possible!
Idate's body is still...</font>

255
00:19:31,400 --> 00:19:35,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he can't run,
then I'll carry him on my back and run!</font>

256
00:19:36,730 --> 00:19:38,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The opponent must already be
in Modoroki Shrine...</font>

257
00:19:39,650 --> 00:19:41,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't give up!</font>

258
00:19:41,360 --> 00:19:42,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey... Naruto...</font>

259
00:19:43,320 --> 00:19:44,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...</font>

260
00:19:45,700 --> 00:19:47,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's leave it to Naruto here.</font>

261
00:19:48,160 --> 00:19:50,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jirocho is waiting for you, right?</font>

262
00:19:51,370 --> 00:19:52,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pull yourself together!</font>

263
00:20:11,350 --> 00:20:14,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boss, don't you think
he actually ran away?</font>

264
00:20:16,060 --> 00:20:16,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He'll come.</font>

265
00:20:17,900 --> 00:20:19,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I believe in Idate!</font>

266
00:20:28,330 --> 00:20:32,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you run away now,
you'll be a loser for your entire life!</font>

267
00:20:32,960 --> 00:20:36,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For the people who believe
in you and wait for you...</font>

268
00:20:40,090 --> 00:20:42,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the fastest boat around here.</font>

269
00:20:42,380 --> 00:20:43,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm grateful.</font>

270
00:20:43,630 --> 00:20:44,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No problem.</font>

271
00:20:45,220 --> 00:20:48,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Edged tools aren't
for hurting people...</font>

272
00:20:49,770 --> 00:20:51,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Show them what you've got!</font>

273
00:20:53,890 --> 00:20:56,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Please take me there!</font>

274
00:20:59,230 --> 00:21:00,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right. Leave it to me!</font>

275
00:21:07,230 --> 00:21:09,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Oravetica"><font color="#ffffff"><b>GET UP aa sumimasen</b></font></font></font>

